{{Passive skill box|Lethality}}

'''Lethality''' is a [[notable passive skill]] that grants additional [[critical strike chance]] and additional [[critical strike multiplier]] to [[Projectile|projectile attack skills]].

==Anointment==
[[Blight (game mechanic)|Blight]] [[anointment]] to unlock the passive:

